        "model": ".model QDRV NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=150 VAF=100 RB=10)\n.model DFLY D(IS=1e-12 RS=0.5)\n.subckt DARLINGTON4 IN1 IN2 IN3 IN4 GND COM OUT4 OUT3 OUT2 OUT1\nRB1 IN1 B1 2.7k\nRP1 IN1 GND 100k\nQ1A OUT1 B1 E1 QDRV\nQ1B OUT1 E1 GND QDRV\nRE1 E1 GND 5k\nD1 OUT1 COM DFLY\nRB2 IN2 B2 2.7k\nRP2 IN2 GND 100k\nQ2A OUT2 B2 E2 QDRV\nQ2B OUT2 E2 GND QDRV\nRE2 E2 GND 5k\nD2 OUT2 COM DFLY\nRB3 IN3 B3 2.7k\nRP3 IN3 GND 100k\nQ3A OUT3 B3 E3 QDRV\nQ3B OUT3 E3 GND QDRV\nRE3 E3 GND 5k\nD3 OUT3 COM DFLY\nRB4 IN4 B4 2.7k\nRP4 IN4 GND 100k\nQ4A OUT4 B4 E4 QDRV\nQ4B OUT4 E4 GND QDRV\nRE4 E4 GND 5k\nD4 OUT4 COM DFLY\n.ends DARLINGTON4\n"
