    {
      "at": [
        -44,
        -30
      ],
      "id": 48,
      "text": "A vendor-style subcircuit as a part (Place > Subcircuit): DARLINGTON4, a four-channel Darlington driver\nwritten in SPICE in examples/models/darlington_array.lib, kept in this project. Run (F5) and close the\nswitches: each input at 5 V makes its output sink the LED's current from 12 V. Copy the .lib file into a\nmodel folder (Tools > Model Folders) to place DARLINGTON4 in your own circuits."
    }
  ],
